{"id": "63029", "title": "圈养", "author": "落月七七", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63029.htm", "intro": "沈蔚蓝是无依无靠的傻妞，整个村子的人都知道。\r\n某天，村子里来了退役的特种兵，在沈蔚蓝家住下。\r\n男人要离开的前一晚，沈蔚蓝屋子里传来惨叫声……\r\n第二天，沈蔚蓝红着眼跟男人离开村子！\r\n其实就是禽兽把傻妞养大的故事……", "base": "files/article/html/63/63029", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "9341348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "9341350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "9341352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "9341354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "9341356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "9341359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "9341361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "9341363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "9341365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-100", "file": "9341368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-110", "file": "9341369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-120", "file": "9341375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-130", "file": "9341377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-140", "file": "9341379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-150", "file": "9341382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "9341384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-170完结", "file": "9341386.html", "available": false}]}